#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:275
msgid "Append to playlist"
msgstr "Na Afspeellist anhangen"

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:314
msgid ""
"Plays the selected song. If :q: is not empty it lists songs matching :q: to "
"play them"
msgstr ""
"Utsöcht Stück afspelen. Is :q: angeven, warrt all op :q: passen Stücken "
"för't Afspelen oplist."

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:316
msgid "Displays songs matching :q: for appending the selected to the playlist"
msgstr "Stücken för't Anhangen na de Afspeellist wiesen, de op :q: passt."

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:318
msgid "Displays songs matching :q: for queueing them"
msgstr "Stücken för't Inregen wiesen, de op :q: passt."

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:321
msgid "Plays a song from playlist"
msgstr "En Stück ut de Afspeellist afspelen"

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:323
msgid "Pauses the playing"
msgstr "Dat Afspelen ünnerbreken"

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:324
msgid "Plays the next song in the playlist if one is available"
msgstr "Dat nakamen Stück binnen de Afspeellist afspelen, wenn vörhannen."

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:325
msgid "Mutes/unmutes the player"
msgstr "Den Afspeler still oder wedder luut maken"

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:327
msgid ""
"Increases the volume by :q:. If :q: is empty it increases by the configured "
"value"
msgstr ""
"De Luutstärk üm :q: ropsetten. Is :q: leddig, warrt de instellt Weert bruukt."

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:329
msgid ""
"Decreases the volume by :q:. If :q: is empty it decreases by the configured "
"value"
msgstr ""
"De Luutstärk üm :q: minnern. Is :q: leddig, warrt de instellt Weert bruukt."

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:330
msgid "Plays the previous song if one is available"
msgstr "Dat verleden Stück afspelen, wenn vörhannen."

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:331
msgid "Stops the playing"
msgstr "Dat Afspelen ophollen"

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:332
msgid "Sets the volume to :q:"
msgstr "De Luutstärk op :q: instellen"

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:333
msgid "Quits the player"
msgstr "Afspeler utmaken"

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:365
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 not found"
msgstr "%1 nich funnen"

#: audioplayercontrolrunner.cpp:366
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 was not found so the runner is unable to work."
msgstr ""

